    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "6089a48d248ef60073948d92",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/34cd24b6a5178b45e45b73c3c9f71e6f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FU-0.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/34cd24b6a5178b45e45b73c3c9f71e6f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FU-0.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/34cd24b6a5178b45e45b73c3c9f71e6f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FU-0.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/34cd24b6a5178b45e45b73c3c9f71e6f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FU-0.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Unknown",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a48d248ef60073948d92",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "It would be nice if someone from the performance and scale group could evaluate this change w/r/t memory use of accessing large containers (containers w/ large numbers of triples). Especially for ntriples or turtle-based output.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "RDFXML-, JSON-LD- and N3-based output is not streamed.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "The useful performance tests would be scoped to repeated GET requests on large containers (i.e. resources w/ many triples):",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "1. For the following serializations (n-triples, rdf/xml, turtle, json-ld):",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "a) what is the avg time to first byte",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "b) what is the avg resource response time",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "2. Same as #1 but with some configurable level of concurrency (e.g. 10 - 20)",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
